    WHEN `o 19 r 41(10)(c) any other reference in Rule 10` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): paragraph (10)(c) disregards only "the references to security for costs in Rule 10(2) and (4)( b )(ii)" and says nothing of the rest

@ref O 19 r 41(11) (src:2863-2866)
GIVEN provision IS A `o 19 r 41(10) provision`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 19 r 41(11) the provision is one to which the replacement of courts applies` MEANS
    CONSIDER provision
    WHEN `o 19 r 41(12)(a) Rule 1(f), which paragraph (12)(a) excepts` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): paragraph (11) speaks of "the provisions mentioned in paragraph (10)", and Rule 1(f) is not among them
    WHEN `o 19 r 41(12)(a) any other provision of Division 1 of this Order` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the provisions mentioned in paragraph (10) apply as if" -- this provision is not mentioned in paragraph (10)
    WHEN `o 19 r 41(12)(b) Order 20` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the provisions mentioned in paragraph (10) apply as if" -- this provision is not mentioned in paragraph (10)
    WHEN `o 19 r 41 any other provision of this Order or of these Rules` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the provisions mentioned in paragraph (10) apply as if" -- this provision is not mentioned in paragraph (10)
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

